                        "entry_id": "e17b124f-c2c4-3753-9749-ed42d1d22dd8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A creator of wonderful things."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e29060e-cdcb-4d8f-8584-03ce805acc8a",
                                "sense_id": "86a7985f-5ae4-32b0-b774-8af1fb272f99",
                                "text": "And now you know you're not alone, because you're part of an international renaissance, part of the noble company of yarnspinners and wondersmiths."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f4df53d-f8ba-477c-b0d8-0021bc03b4a2",
                                "sense_id": "86a7985f-5ae4-32b0-b774-8af1fb272f99",
                                "text": "And there is what the highest pagan wisdom ended in— yes, in calling up spirits, and the shady operations of wizards and wonder-smiths."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5800595f-b6fa-4b35-a0f8-3c20a2fe31c9",
                                "sense_id": "86a7985f-5ae4-32b0-b774-8af1fb272f99",
                                "text": "The dwarves were supposed to be wondersmiths, hammering out marvelous things in their caverns—and the giants built huge stone castles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
